WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:10.945
Hand Wash na Dish Wash Mmiri Mmiri site na Usoro Pasentị. Nke a bụ nkebi 2 nke usoro ọmụmụ a.

2
00:00:11.316 --> 00:00:23.675
Taa ị ga-agwakọta hand wash dị nro, ya bụ ncha mmiri maka ịsa aka, n'ime bọket, mee ka ọ gbaa ọkpụrụkpụ na-emebighị ya, ma họrọ ncha efere site n'ọnụọgụ efere ọ sara n'ezie.

3
00:00:24.675 --> 00:00:31.376
Ihe niile ị hụrụ ka ọ na-aga n'elu scale a, a na-atụ ya dị ka pasentị nke batch.

4
00:00:31.701 --> 00:00:41.952
N'ụzọ dị otu a, otu akwụkwọ ahụ na-arụ ọrụ maka nnwale 2 kilogram ma ọ bụ batch 200 kilogram. Naanị ị na-amụba.

5
00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:54.273
Nke a bụ usoro mmalite maka batch nnwale. Active matter ruru pasentị 9.9, ọkwa dị n'etiti maka aka.

6
00:00:55.273 --> 00:01:10.451
Chiamaka nke Enugu chọrọ 10 kilogram, ihe dị ka karama 20 nke 500 mililita. O ji 10,000 gram mụbaa pasentị ọ bụla wee kewaa ya na 100.

7
00:01:10.788 --> 00:01:19.679
Mgbe ahụ ọ gbakọtara ahịrị niile ka o hụ na ọ ruru 10,000 gram kpọmkwem, ma tụọ akara n'ibu ọ bụla ka ọ na-abanye.

8
00:01:20.679 --> 00:01:32.848
Yiri gloves na goggles tupu i meghee SLES paste ma ọ bụ mmanụ isi ụtọ. Ha abụọ nwere ike ịkpasu akpụkpọ ahụ na anya iwe.

9
00:01:33.848 --> 00:01:44.288
Lee drum dị ọcha. Tụọ mmiri, debe ihe dị ka pasentị 10 maka emechaa, ma kpalie EDTA ruo mgbe ọ gbazere.

10
00:01:44.704 --> 00:01:52.821
Ugbu a SLES paste na-abanye, iberibe iberibe, ka osisi nkpali na-agagharị nwayọọ. Kpalie nwayọọ ka ikuku ghara ịbanye.

11
00:01:53.151 --> 00:01:57.454
Mgbe ọ dị larịị na-enweghị mkpụrụ, tinye CAPB na glycerin ma kpalie ruo mgbe ọ dị otu.

12
00:01:58.454 --> 00:02:03.672
Lee dropper ahụ. Buru ụzọ gwakọta isi ụtọ na ntakịrị CAPB, ka hand wash ghara ịdị apịtị apịtị.

13
00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:07.311
Mgbe ahụ tinye preservative na agba ọ bụla.

14
00:02:08.311 --> 00:02:20.323
Hapụ ya ka ọ zuo ike minit 15, wee tinye strip. Ihe ị na-achọ bụ ihe dị ka 5.5 ruo 6.5.

15
00:02:20.788 --> 00:02:30.562
Ọ bụrụ na ọ dị elu, jiri mmiri citric acid wedata ya, buru ụzọ nwalee ihe nlele, dị ka i mụtara na nkebi 1.

16
00:02:31.562 --> 00:02:40.105
Nnu na-eme ka ọ gbaa ọkpụrụkpụ ruo n'ọnụ ya, mgbe ahụ mmiri ahụ na-alaghachi dị mmiri mmiri, ị gaghịkwa enwe ike iwepụ nnu.

17
00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:49.544
Ya mere Ruth nke Jos tụrụ ihe nlele 200 gram anọ ma tinye nnu dị iche iche n'ime nke ọ bụla.

18
00:02:50.042 --> 00:03:05.005
Ọkpụrụkpụ rịrị elu ruo pasentị 1.5 ma daa na pasentị 2.0. Ọnụ ya dị ihe dị ka pasentị 1.5, nke dabara n'usoro sekọnd 15 ruo 25 ya.

19
00:03:06.005 --> 00:03:18.105
Ugbu a lee ka ọ na-agba ọkpụrụkpụ. Ruth gbazere 300 gram nnu ya n'ime 1,200 gram mmiri o debere, iji mee mmiri nnu pasentị 20.

20
00:03:18.467 --> 00:03:29.500
Ọ wụnyere ya n'akụkụ atọ, na-akpali ma na-anwale mgbe nke ọ bụla gachara. Batch ahụ ruru ihe dị ka sekọnd 20 na-agafeghị ọnụ ya.

21
00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:41.497
Kpuchie batch ahụ ka ọ zuo ike n'abalị niile ka afụ rịgoro. Mgbe ahụ tụnyere ya na usoro gị na ihe nlele gị, wee wụnye ya n'karama.

22
00:03:41.975 --> 00:03:49.249
Batch dara nnwale ka a na-ejide ma dozie, ọ dịghị mgbe a na-ere ya maka na ọ fọrọ obere ka ọ dị mma.

23
00:03:50.249 --> 00:04:03.584
Ncha efere nwere ọrụ siri ike karịa. N'akwụkwọ ya, Zainab nke Kano nwalere usoro abụọ n'otu ụzọ: 2 gram mmanụ n'efere ọ bụla, 5 lita mmiri ọkụ ọkụ, dose 5 mililita.

24
00:04:03.964 --> 00:04:15.256
Ọ sara ruo mgbe ụfụfụ kwụsịrị ma gụọ efere. Usoro A dị oke ọnụ kwa lita mana ọ dị ọnụ ala kwa efere, ọ kakwara ncha a ma ama n'ahịa. Ọ họọrọ A.

25
00:04:16.256 --> 00:04:25.982
Nwalee ncha efere kwa. Debe ya ihe dị ka 6 ruo 8, nke dị nro n'aka na-anọ n'ime mmiri ogologo oge.

26
00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:43.190
Etinyela caustic soda ma ọ bụ soda ash maka ike karịa. Ọ na-akpasu akpụkpọ ahụ ma nwee ike ime ka ite aluminium gbaa ọchịchịrị.

27
00:04:44.190 --> 00:04:48.328
Lee karama ndị a n'ahịa: ezi karama detergent nwere label.

28
00:04:48.710 --> 00:05:01.520
Ejila karama minerals ochie ma ọ bụ karama mmiri. Mmadụ nwere ike ịṅụ ihe dị n'ime ya. Bipụta "Debe ya ebe ụmụaka anaghị eru" na ahịrị enyemaka mbụ.

29
00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:11.888
Agba cosmetic na-esi ike nke ukwuu, ya mere mee mmiri stock pasentị 1 ma tụọ nke ahụ kama.

30
00:05:12.303 --> 00:05:18.675
Mgbe ihe mebiri, gbanwee naanị otu ihe n'ihe nlele ọ bụla ma dee ya.

31
00:05:19.675 --> 00:05:29.913
Ugbu a gụọ ihe ọmụmụ ndị dị n'okpuru. Mee batch nnwale 2 kilogram gị, mee nnwale efere nke gị, ma see eserese nnu gị. Ọnụọgụ gị ga-agwa gị ihe na-arụ ọrụ.

